  abilityName: Arisen Crusade
  abilityDesc: 20 combo Light attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining HP),
    boosts max HP, 100% damage reduction for 4 turns, boosts Atk, Def, Rec relative
    to max HP for 4 turns, damage taken fills BB gauge for 4 turns & damage taken
    restores HP for 4 turns
